&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About Teneo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Teneo is the global CEO advisory firm. We partner with our clients globally to do great things for a better future.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Drawing upon our global team and expansive network of senior advisors, we provide advisory services across our five business segments on a stand-alone or fully integrated basis to help our clients solve complex business challenges. Our clients include a significant number of the Fortune 100 and FTSE 100, as well as other corporations, financial institutions, and organizations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our full range of advisory services includes strategic communications, investor relations, financial transactions and restructuring, management consulting, physical and cyber risk, organizational design, board and executive search, geopolitics and government affairs, corporate governance,&amp;nbsp;and ESG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The firm has more than 1,600 employees located in 40+ offices around the world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;Hudson River Trading (HRT) is seeking a Research Data Expert to join our Data team. Data is a cornerstone of HRT’s trading strategies, serving as the raw fuel that powers research, automated trading, and risk management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will own a specific area of expertise, working on sourcing junior data engineers, platform engineers, and alpha researchers to build and maintain trading strategies. You will also be responsible for providing fully featurized datasets to statistical modeling researchers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HRT does not have information siloes. You will be collaborating directly with our researchers and will be responsible for driving&amp;nbsp; the business forward through rigorous data analysis and delivery. You will also manage the full end-to-end pipeline from vendor downloads to trading-ready data. As an expert in one area, you will mentor junior data engineers, assisting and validating their work, and will partner with our sourcing team to identify optimal opportunities for data procurement. Furthermore, you will be responsible for ensuring high-quality service by implementing rigorous data checks and alerts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain fully featurized datasets for statistical modeling research&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the subject matter expert for a designated data domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical support and guidance to researchers on vendor data and derived datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and direct junior data engineers, including performing code and data output validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the sourcing team to identify and evaluate new data procurement opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze data to identify and improve alpha&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the full end-to-end data pipeline, from raw vendor ingestion to refined feature sets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide on-call support for data issues during normal business hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement automated data quality checks and monitoring alerts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills (Python/R preferred) and proficiency in data science methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience in a specific data domain (e.g., alternative data, fundamentals, security reference, or economic data)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of building alpha through detailed data analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undergraduate degree in a STEM field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The estimated base salary range for this position is 200,000 to 300,000 USD per year (or local equivalent). The base pay offered may vary depending on multiple individualized factors, including location, job-related knowledge, skills, and experience. This role will also be eligible for discretionary performance-based bonuses and a competitive benefits package.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-value=&quot;{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Hudson River Trading (HRT) brings a scientific approach to trading financial products. We have built one of the world&#39;s most sophisticated computing environments for research and development. Our researchers are at the forefront of innovation in the world of algorithmic trading. \n\nAt HRT we come from a variety of disciplines: mathematics and computer science, physics, and engineering, media and tech. We’re a community of self-starters who are motivated by the excitement of being at the cutting edge of automation in every part of our organization - from trading, to business operations, to recruiting and beyond.  Our culture celebrates great ideas whether they come from HRT veterans or new hires.  At HRT we’re friends and colleagues – whether we are sharing a meal, playing the latest board game, or writing elegant code. We embrace a culture of togetherness that extends far beyond the walls of our office.\n\nFeel like you belong at HRT? Our goal is to find the best people and bring them together to do great work in a place where everyone is valued. HRT is proud of our diverse staff; we have offices all over the globe and benefit from our varied and unique perspectives. HRT is an equal opportunity employer; so whoever you are we’d love to get to know you.&amp;quot;}&quot; data-sheets-userformat=&quot;{&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:13185,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0},&amp;quot;10&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;11&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;12&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;15&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;IBM Plex Sans&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;16&amp;quot;:11}&quot; data-sheets-textstyleruns=&quot;{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0}{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:328,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:16711935}}}{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:402}{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:917,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:16711935}}}{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:945}&quot;&gt;Hudson River Trading (HRT) brings a scientific approach to trading financial products. We have built one of the world&#39;s most sophisticated computing environments for research and development. Our researchers are at the forefront of innovation in the world of algorithmic trading. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At HRT we welcome a variety of expertise: mathematics and computer science, physics and engineering, media and tech. We’re a community of self-starters who are motivated by the excitement of being at the cutting edge of automation in every part of our organization—from trading, to business operations, to recruiting and beyond. We value openness and transparency, and celebrate great ideas from HRT veterans and new hires alike. At HRT we’re friends and colleagues – whether we are sharing a meal, playing the latest board game, or writing elegant code. We embrace a culture of togetherness that extends far beyond the walls of our office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Feel like you belong at HRT? Our goal is to find the best people and bring them together to do great work in a place where everyone is valued. HRT is proud of our diverse staff; we have offices all over the globe and benefit from our varied and unique perspectives. HRT is an equal opportunity employer; so whoever you are we’d love to get to know you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
